            "text": {
              "status": "generated",
              "div": "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><h3>Annotation</h3><table class=\"hl7__eu__lab__report\"><tr><th>Conclusion and Recommendations based on this report and previous findings known to us:</th></tr><tr><td>All parameters are within normal limits except for a markedly elevated creatinine (2.9 mg/dL), indicating significant renal dysfunction. Other renal markers (urea nitrogen, electrolytes) are normal, and there is no evidence of electrolyte imbalance or hypercalcemia. Recommend prompt clinical evaluation for possible acute or chronic kidney disease.</td></tr></table></div>"
